<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-ALGERIAN FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ALGERIAN FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Algerian first</p>
<p>division soccer matches on Thursday:</p>
<p>  Mouloudia Club Alger    3     Sportif Constantine 0</p>
<p>  Mouloudia  Constantine  1     Mouloudia Alger     0</p>
<p>  Chabab Belouizdad	 2     Jeunesse Kabylie    0</p>
<p>  Association Ain M'Lila  1     Widad Mostaganem    0</p>
<p>  Widad Tlemcen	     1     Chabab Batna	  0</p>
<p>  Utihad el Harrach	 1     Utihad Ain Beida    0</p>
<p>  Mouloudia Oran	    1     Widad Boufarik	0</p>
<p>  Utihad Chaouia	    v     Nadit Hussein Dey   postponed</p>
</text>
